-<div id="log">
-    Audio bytes decoded: 0 average p/s: 0<br>
-    Video bytes decoded: 0 average p/s: 0<br>
-    Decoded frames: 0 average p/s: 0<br>
-    Dropped frames: 0 average p/s: 0<br>
