>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 17:57:17 +0000"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Patrick Meenan <pmeenan@google.com>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Console warning is easy enough to implement since the code to track if a sheet would be impacted by","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"'Patrick Meenan' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 14:05:40 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"On Thu, May 26, 2016 at 11:05 AM, &#39;Patrick Meenan&#39; via blink-dev &lt;blink-dev@chromium.org","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Elliott Sprehn <esprehn@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 11:08:27 -0700"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Patrick Meenan <pmeenan@google.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Is there at least an issue filed in some W3C or WHATWG GitHub for the fact that the spec doesn&#39;t","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 14:10:07 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Patrick Meenan <pmeenan@google.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Reliably at runtime I can detect when a script-blocking stylesheet is activated after the body has","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"'Patrick Meenan' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 14:14:43 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Implementation is a necessary first step. The Edge behavior of blocking the parser still requires","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"'Patrick Meenan' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 14:21:05 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Elliott Sprehn <esprehn@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"On Thu, May 26, 2016 at 2:14 PM, Patrick Meenan &lt;pmeenan@google.com&gt; wrote: Reliably at runtime","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 14:28:20 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Patrick Meenan <pmeenan@google.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"As far as specs go, any recommendations where I should poke for specs about painting behavior? There","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"'Patrick Meenan' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 May 2016 14:50:58 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"Is this change in any way observable to web content? Blocking the parser would be like Edge does","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"Philip Jägenstedt\" <foolip@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Fri, 27 May 2016 14:14:03 +0200"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Patrick Meenan <pmeenan@google.com>, Ian Hickson <ian@hixie.ch>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>, Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"I think this is one of those quality-of-implementation issues. I doubt any spec talks about it. On","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"Ian Hickson <ian@hixie.ch>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Fri, 27 May 2016 17:29:32 +0000"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"\"Philip Jägenstedt\" <foolip@chromium.org>, Patrick Meenan <pmeenan@google.com>"},{"name":"Cc","value":"Rick Byers <rbyers@chromium.org>, Chris Harrelson <chrishtr@chromium.org>, blink-dev <blink-dev@chromium.org>"}]}},{"snippet":"It should be completely transparent to scripts and unlikely to be observable from code. I&#39;m not","payload":{"headers":[{"name":"From","value":"\"'Patrick Meenan' via blink-dev\" <blink-dev@chromium.org>"},{"name":"Date","value":"Fri, 27 May 2016 13:39:18 -0400"},{"name":"Subject","value":"Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: Stylesheets activated after the body is started do not block paint"},{"name":"To","value":"Ian Hickson <ian@hixie.ch>